        {
          "level": 0,
          "text": "The whole chapter in one sentence"
        },
        {
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Use at for one-time future tasks, cron for recurring schedules, Anacron to help periodic jobs catch up after downtime, systemd timers to activate systemd units, and systemd-tmpfiles to manage temporary files."
